
                       geant4-11-02-ref-07
                       ===================

Major development/fixes included since the last development tag are:

 o Added support for accumulable collections in analysis module.
 o Improved use of Mutex lock in G4EventManager for sub-event level parallelism.
 o Temporarily disabled default parallel optimisation in G4GeometryManager,
   to allow for further testing and refinements to implementation.
 o New processes G4DynamicParticleIonisation, G4DynamicParticleMSC and
   G4DynamicParticleFluctuation, which perform computations on the fly using
   only G4DynamicParticle data.
 o New class G4PolarizedOrePowellAtRestModel for polarized Orel & Powell
   orto positronium decay model at rest.
 o Introduced new classes G4UnknownParticle and G4ChargedUnknownParticle,
   part of ATLAS and LHCb request to assign automatically ionisation and
   multiple scattering processes to charged primary particles with valid PDG
   code but not known to Geant4.
 o New class G4XSectionXS, to compute inverse cross-section using G4PARTICLEXS
   cross-sections for neutrons and light ions.
 o Added "HPT" extension to support adding G4ThermalNeutrons to extensible
   physlist factory.
 o In visualization, fixes for Qt5 and Qt6 to avoid a crash in case of
   "/run/beamOn" is called in vis.mac at startup.
 o Fixed many Coverity defects reported after tool upgrade.
 o Synchronised internal PTL tasking library with version PTL-3.0.0.
 o New dataset: G4CHANNELINGDATA-1.0 and G4EMLOW-8.6.1.

